      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. to make it really convincing, i think i need to lean into the \"civilizing\" aspect a bit more. like, how can i frame the introduction of these systems not just as \"tools\" but as a necessary way to bring order and stability to regions that were supposedly disorganized or lacked that kind of advanced structure before? i want to show that there was a certain level of progress or advancement that wouldn't have happened otherwise. how can i phrase that without sounding too aggressive?",
